<div class="relative flex items-start gap-space-base"><div class="absolute -left-6 top-1 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-secondary-fixed flex items-center justify-center text-on-secondary-fixed ring-4 ring-surface-container-lowest"><svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 text-on-secondary-fixed" fill="none" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3"></polyline></svg></div><div class="flex flex-col flex-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-body-medium text-body-medium font-semibold text-on-surface">3. Формирование черновика публикации</span><span class="font-code-mono text-label-sm text-secondary font-semibold bg-secondary-fixed/30 px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">OK · 5 сек</span></div><p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-0.5">Медиа-группа подготовлена, сформированы кнопки быстрого перехода на сайт.</p><span class="font-body-sm text-label-sm text-outline mt-1">Черновик сохранен</span></div></div>
